  "$Comment": [
    "The chain's last rung, a long shift: four hundred Sawmill cycles and Woodcutting level forty,",
    "both on Order 1 so they progress together.",
    "",
    "long_shifts is WORK_STATION on the station id; reach_forty is STAT_THRESHOLD, which reads a",
    "native stat channel by id (MMO_Level_WOODCUTTING) and holds the high-water reading, so a level",
    "already reached counts the moment the quest is taken. No hand-in: TurnInId 'giver' still",
    "settles it at Marn. Rewards sit in Claim: XP, a longer and stronger personal boost token, and a",
    "stack of concentrated essence. Completing this quest is also what the Master Sawyer",
    "achievement counts, so a retune here changes what that achievement asks."
  ],
